  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsAPI-Common/blob/master/img/title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"标志\"></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsAPI-Common/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/895334913560178698/1118530263329288362/wiki.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/7BSqZa9r3P\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/895334913560178698/915683102192468018/JoinDiscord.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsAPI-Common/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/895334913560178698/915683907649822750/reportissue.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmavapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/t4Ybtys2?logo=modrinth&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmavapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/game-versions/t4Ybtys2?logo=modrinth&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_709964_downloads.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"下载量\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/709964.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"版本\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong>介绍</strong></h1><ul>\n<li>轻量级 API，其他模组可使用它来添加新的美西螈变种，同时保持彼此兼容</li>\n<li>本身不添加任何新变种</li>\n<li>提供为模组变种添加自定义美西螈桶物品模型的可能性</li>\n</ul><h1><strong>开箱即用功能</strong></h1><ul>\n<li>为美西螈桶添加工具提示，显示其<strong>年龄</strong>、<strong>变种</strong>及来源<strong>模组</strong></li>\n<li>将所有原版变种的美西螈桶物品纹理更改为其对应的变种纹理（纹理由 <a href=\"https://github.com/NewSrVraxx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">VRAXX</a> 制作）</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong>模组推荐</strong></h1><h2><strong>更多美西螈 (Fabric) - DomiIRL</strong></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-axolotl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://u.svrt.dev/u/watery-abandoned-antarcticfurseal.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-axolotl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y5TW2Ou.png\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;</p><h2><strong>更多美西螈变种模组 (Fabric &amp; Forge) - AkashiiKun69</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsMod-Common/blob/master/img/title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mavm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsMod-Common/master/img/new_variants.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong>面向所有用户的信息</strong></h1><h2><strong>召唤指令</strong></h2><p>现在可以通过将字符串值作为“Variant”NBT 来召唤美西螈。</p><p>这与 Minecraft 在大多数地方使用的命名空间系统相似，但某些实体变种（包括美西螈）并未采用。</p><p>例如，以下是召唤原版 lucy 变种的方法：</p><pre><code>/summon minecraft:axolotl ~ ~ ~ {Variant:\"minecraft:lucy\"}</code></pre><p>或召唤来自“更多美西螈”模组的变种：</p><pre><code>/summon minecraft:axolotl ~ ~ ~ {Variant:\"more-axolotl:neon\"}</code></pre><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong>面向模组开发者的信息</strong></h1><p>关于使用此 API 进行模组开发的详细信息，请参阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/AkashiiKun/MoreAxolotlVariantsAPI-Common/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。</p>",
